<title>NIGERIA: Nigeria Coke bottler half yr profits higher.</title>
<headline>Nigeria Coke bottler half yr profits higher.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year results for Nigerian Bottling Company, local bottlers of Coca Cola, to end-June 1996.</p>
<p>(In million naira)</p>
<p>					  1996		1995</p>
<p> Turnover			    8,400   vs	7,900</p>
<p> Profit before taxation	    969.8 vs	  911.1</p>
<p> Taxation				290.9 vs	  273.3</p>
<p> Profit after taxation	     678.9 vs	  637.8</p>
<p> Minority interest		    47.6 vs	   22.1</p>
<p>Profit after taxation and minority interest</p>
<p>					   631.3 vs	  615.7</p>
<p>($1=80 naira)</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
